{"title":"CSS: Box Model","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"border:1px solid black; background:#CEE0F2;text-align:center;\" align=\"center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#B0C4DE;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS\" title=\"CSS\">CSS</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Basics\" title=\"CSS: Basics\">Basics</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Backgrounds\" title=\"CSS: Backgrounds\">Backgrounds</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Text\" title=\"CSS: Text\">Text</a> - <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Box Model</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Selectors_and_Combinators\" title=\"CSS: Selectors and Combinators\">Selectors and Combinators</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Pseudo-class_and_Pseudo-element\" title=\"CSS: Pseudo-class and Pseudo-element\">Pseudo-class and Pseudo-element</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Gradients&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CSS: Gradients (page does not exist)\">Gradients</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Animations_and_Transitions\" title=\"CSS: Animations and Transitions\">Animations and Transitions</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_CSS_in_AoPS\" title=\"CSS: CSS in AoPS\">CSS in AoPS</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_List_of_Elements\" title=\"CSS: List of Elements\">List of Elements</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>In CSS every element is considered a box. The model below is the CSS box model\n</p>\n<div style=\"border:2px solid black;border-radius:10px;width:300px;height:300px;\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">Margin</p>\n<div style=\"border:2px solid black;border-radius:10px;width:275px;height:250px;left-margin:auto;right-margin:auto;\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">Border</p>\n<div style=\"border:2px solid black;border-radius:10px;width:250px;height:200px;left-margin:auto;right-margin:auto;\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">Padding</p>\n<div style=\"border:2px solid black;border-radius:10px;width:225px;height:150px;left-margin:auto;right-margin:auto;\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">Inner</p>\n</div></div></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018075400\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 11/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 600/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.825      1 Template:CSS\n100.00%    7.825      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:11201:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018075400 and revision id 47327. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}